dgodriver is a Go port based on the supplied nodriver and zendriver projects.

Reference implementation: zendriver 0.17.1
https://github.com/cdpdriver/zendriver

Original project: nodriver
https://github.com/ultrafunkamsterdam/nodriver

The reference projects are licensed under the GNU Affero General Public
License, version 3. The full license is included in LICENSE.

Chrome DevTools Protocol declarations originate from Chromium's protocol
specification and the generated PyCDP declarations shipped with zendriver.
https://chromedevtools.github.io/devtools-protocol/

Runtime dependency: github.com/gorilla/websocket, BSD-2-Clause.
Its license remains in the dependency distribution.
